OL,3,GNEWSAUK must adapt to changing climate,
OL,4,Asays Tice
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK should "learn to adapt to the
OL,7,Fchanging climate, rather than
OL,8,Farrogantly think you can stop the power
OL,9,Fof the sun", Reform UK's deputy leader
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FAccording to the Met Office, this
OL,13,Fsummer is the hottest on record, with
OL,14,Ffive separate heatwaves.
OL,16,FAhead of the party's national
OL,17,Fconference in Birmingham this week,
OL,18,FRichard Tice was asked about climate
OL,19,Fchange, including criticism he received
OL,20,Ffor previously telling people they
OL,21,Fshould enjoy the prolonged hot weather.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
