OL,3,GNEWSAUK must adapt to changing climate,
OL,4,Asays Tice
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I get criticised all the time, but
OL,7,Fit's true isn't it? People have enjoyed
OL,8,Fthe warm weather," he told BBC South
OL,9,FEast.
